# ruff: noqa: E501  (one question a line: easier to read and check)
"""Skill check questions, second batch (13 Nov live test: every test had exactly 10 questions, so each attempt was
the same paper). Original multiple-choice questions written for Nm7: more for the first eight tests, so each has 24
and a test draws 10 at random, and ten new tests (Java, web basics, software testing, spoken English for BPO,
nursing basics, mechanical / diploma basics, delivery and logistics, Tally and GST, data entry, retail).

Added once to the live bank, also when it already has questions (skillcheck.ensure_bank). Each question gets a fixed
id from its text, so adding twice never makes duplicates; Admin's edits and turned-off questions are never touched.
Options are shuffled for every attempt, so the right option's place here doesn't matter.
"""

